From 598474aa238d55d4e485dbf4a65084187f8ff220 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: retropineaple <118107729+retropineaple@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:03:09 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 46/54] Complete stamps lost in a GPU hang reset
 (-wex-reset-restore)

Stamps whose work the reset dropped never return, so IOAccel's progress
check signals a restart for them every few seconds and skips it for lack
of a channel, stalling the GPU work loop each time. Two seconds after a
recovery, complete stamp slots still behind their last issued value that
have not moved since the recovery.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 README.md              |  2 +-
 README_ja.md           |  2 +-
 WhateverXe/kern_xe.cpp | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 38 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

